  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The table gives the mass and radius of two spherical planets, <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> and <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>, which are assumed to be uniform.</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Planet</th><th>Mass</th><th>Radius</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3M\"></span></td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12R\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>The escape speed from the surface of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v_{\\text{e}}\"></span>. What is the escape speed from the surface of planet <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.25 v_{\\text{e}}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.50 v_{\\text{e}}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0 v_{\\text{e}}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0 v_{\\text{e}}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
